%% Design correction recorded before changing the runner, 2026-11-05.
flowchart TD
    Start[Start bounded task under workspace lock] --> Walk[Walk workspace without following links]
    Walk --> Generated{Known generated directory?}
    Generated -->|.git / .godot / .tools / .artifacts / builds / logs / caches| Prune[Prune before descending]
    Generated -->|no| Link{Symbolic link?}
    Link -->|yes| Target[Record target string without following]
    Link -->|no| Deadline{Within fixed runtime deadline?}
    Deadline -->|yes| Hash[Hash first-party file bytes]
    Deadline -->|no| Stop[Record limit reached]
    Hash --> Compare[Compare before and after fingerprints]
    Target --> Compare
    Compare --> Scope[Report outside-scope edits; preserve user files]
    Scope --> Worker[Only then run the fixed checks and one coding worker]
